cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "PMR: memory-scalable 4D-CT deformable registration for consumer GPUs"
abstract: >-
  Phase-manifold registration of 4D-CT: the ten breathing phases are represented
  as one periodic curve in the breathing phase, so loop closure is an algebraic
  identity. Full-resolution (1 mm) registration of a 144-million-voxel ten-phase
  series completes on an 8 GiB consumer card with a measured peak allocation of
  3.25 GiB, with a verification suite that runs alongside training.
